"senior_day_label" = "Senior Day";
"senior_day_text" = "We will be open on the third Wednesday of each month from 12:00–2:00pm exclusively for seniors and those with medical diagnoses. You must have one of our Early Entry cards for this shopping day.";
"settings_button_label" = "Settings";
"shopping_label" = "In pantry shopping";
"shopping_text" = "All clients must have a profile with Link2Feed. Have your Client ID handy when you report.\n\nWhen your number is called, step to the front desk to register your visit. We need your Client ID and accurate household information so we can continue to provide services to all of our clients.\n\nShop only for your own household. Do not attempt to cheat the system and have multiple family members shop separately. You may be asked to leave and not return.\n\nLimits are placed on items so all clients may shop. All food items are “first come, first served” so options may be more limited as distribution moves along. Our apologies.\n\nWhen you are done shopping, your food will be transferred from the shopping cart to a plastic trolley. Do not take the shopping cart outside of the building, use the plastic trolley instead. Our volunteers will assist you and push the plastic trolley outside while you get your vehicle and bring it to the loading zone.\n\nPlease park only in the back three rows of the main parking lot. The main lot is reserved for the medical center. The front lot is reserved for workers and other businesses.";
